# doc: misc/marketing/screenshot-docs/Edmund.md
# window: 820,560
# modes: light
# length: 10500
# appstore: yes
# expect: Live preview, bold, italic, code
# alt: Typing in Edmund: a heading, bold, italic and code render as they are typed.
# Live preview: Markdown renders as you type, the marks showing only on the
# line being typed. New text goes above the callout so the whole document
# stays in view.
zoom in
caret > [!note]
# --- record ---
sleep 700
type ## Live preview
sleep 250
enter
enter
sleep 250
type Type **bold**, *italic* and `code`: it renders as you go.
sleep 300
enter
enter
sleep 200
save
